<main class="oc">
<section class="ow oh"><div><div class="oe">Engine protection</div><h1 class="ot">Oil change service near you</h1><p class="ocp">Regular oil changes help protect your engine, support reliable performance, and keep your vehicle ready for daily driving. Our technicians use the appropriate oil and filter for your vehicle’s needs.</p><a class="ob" href="#oil-book">Request an appointment →</a></div><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-63.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Technician performing an oil change"></section>
<section class="os oa"><div class="ow g2"><article class="op"><div class="oe">Signs to watch for</div><h3>Signs you may need an oil change</h3><p>Timely oil service helps prevent old oil from reducing engine protection.</p><ul class="ol"><li>Oil change reminder is on</li><li>Oil appears dark or low</li><li>Engine sounds louder than usual</li><li>Mileage interval is due</li></ul></article><article class="op"><div class="oe">What’s included</div><h3>What’s included in an oil change?</h3><p>Every oil change is completed with the core service your vehicle needs.</p><ul class="ol"><li>Drain used oil and install fresh oil</li><li>Install a new oil filter</li><li>Reset your maintenance reminder</li><li>Multi-point courtesy inspection</li></ul></article></div></section>
<section class="os od"><div class="ow center"><div class="oe">Good to know</div><h2 class="ot">Oil change — how often, how long, and what it costs</h2><p class="ocp">Most vehicles need service every 5,000–7,500 miles, or according to the owner’s manual. Oil type and vehicle requirements affect service timing and price.</p><div class="g3" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="op"><h3>Routine service</h3><p>Regular oil changes help keep your engine lubricated, cooler, and protected.</p></article><article class="op"><h3>Same-day options</h3><p>Most oil changes can be completed during a single visit.</p></article><article class="op"><h3>Clear recommendations</h3><p>We confirm the appropriate oil type and service for your vehicle.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="os"><div class="ow center"><div class="oe">How booking works</div><h2 class="ot">From request to back on the road</h2><div class="g4" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="op step"><b>1</b><h3>Request online</h3><p>Choose a nearby store.</p></article><article class="op step"><b>2</b><h3>Check in</h3><p>Tell us about your vehicle and service needs.</p></article><article class="op step"><b>3</b><h3>Service & inspect</h3><p>We change the oil and complete a courtesy inspection.</p></article><article class="op step"><b>4</b><h3>Back on the road</h3><p>Leave with fresh oil and a clear service summary.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="os oa"><div class="ow split"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-63.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Oil change service at American Tire Stores"><div><div class="oe">Why it matters</div><h2 class="ot">Why regular oil changes matter</h2><p class="ocp">Engine oil breaks down as it collects heat, debris, and moisture. Replacing it on time helps reduce wear and protects the engine parts that keep your vehicle moving.</p><ul class="ol"><li>Helps protect engine components from wear</li><li>Supports proper lubrication and cooling</li><li>Removes old oil and contaminants</li><li>Helps maintain reliable everyday performance</li></ul></div></div></section>
<section class="os"><div class="ow center"><div class="oe">Choose the right oil</div><h2 class="ot">Which oil is right for your vehicle?</h2><p class="ocp">The correct oil depends on your vehicle, engine, mileage, and the manufacturer’s specifications.</p><div class="g3" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="op"><h3>Conventional oil</h3><p>A dependable option for vehicles designed for conventional oil service.</p></article><article class="op"><h3>Synthetic blend</h3><p>Balances enhanced protection with value for many vehicles and driving conditions.</p></article><article class="op"><h3>Full synthetic</h3><p>Provides advanced protection for vehicles that require or benefit from synthetic oil.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="os od"><div class="ow center"><div class="oe">Quality you can trust</div><h2 class="ot">Quality oil & filters, every time</h2><p class="ocp">One complete oil-and-filter service section—your vehicle receives the oil type and filter appropriate for its needs.</p><div class="g3" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="op"><h3>Appropriate oil type</h3><p>We confirm the service required for your engine and driving needs.</p></article><article class="op"><h3>New oil filter</h3><p>A new filter is installed as part of every oil change service.</p></article><article class="op"><h3>Courtesy inspection</h3><p>We look for common maintenance concerns while your vehicle is in the shop.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="os oa"><div class="ow split"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-67.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Customer discussing oil service"><div><div class="oe">Straightforward options</div><h2 class="ot">What does an oil change cost?</h2><p class="ocp">Cost depends on your vehicle and the oil it requires. Choose a store to request service and your advisor can confirm the appropriate oil-change option. Financing is available for qualifying customers.</p><a class="ob" href="/pages/financing">Explore financing →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="os od" id="oil-book"><div class="ow center"><div class="oe">Request an appointment</div><h2 class="ot">Book an oil change at your store</h2><p class="ocp">Choose your nearest American Tire Stores location to begin your oil-change request.</p><div class="book"><div class="row"><select id="oil-store" aria-label="Choose a store"><option value="">Choose your store</option><option value="52820">Ventura</option><option value="52819">Thousand Oaks</option><option value="52819">Valencia</option><option value="61758">Hollywood</option><option value="52816">Glendale</option><option value="52818">Glendale 2</option><option value="52814">Bellflower</option><option value="52814">Costa Mesa</option><option value="52815">Cathedral City</option></select><button type="button" class="ob" onclick="window.startOilBooking()">Request oil change →</button></div><div id="oil-widget" class="widget">Choose a store above to begin your oil-change request.</div></div></div></section>
<section class="os"><div class="ow center"><div class="oe">Why American Tire Stores</div><h2 class="ot">Service Southern California drivers trust</h2><div class="g3" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="op"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“Quick, professional oil change and the team made it easy to understand what my vehicle needed.”</p><b>American Tire Stores customer</b></article><article class="op"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“They confirmed the right oil, completed the service, and I was back on the road without delay.”</p><b>American Tire Stores customer</b></article><article class="op"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“Clear service, fair explanation, and an easy appointment from start to finish.”</p><b>American Tire Stores customer</b></article></div></div></section>
<section class="os oa"><div class="ow center"><div class="oe">Near you</div><h2 class="ot">Oil changes near you, across Southern California</h2><p class="ocp">Oil change service is available at all nine American Tire Stores locations.</p><div class="locs"><article class="loc"><h3>Ventura</h3><p>5100 Telegraph Rd<br>(805) 644-3330</p><a href="/pages/location-ventura-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Thousand Oaks</h3><p>621 E Thousand Oaks Blvd<br>(805) 379-1910</p><a href="/pages/location-thousand-oaks-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Valencia</h3><p>23510 Valencia Blvd, Unit A<br>(661) 596-1444</p><a href="/pages/location-valencia-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Hollywood</h3><p>1174 N Western Ave<br>(323) 372-9372</p><a href="/pages/location-hollywood-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Glendale</h3><p>737 S Glendale Ave<br>(818) 243-3191</p><a href="/pages/location-glendale-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Glendale 2</h3><p>1130 S Central Ave<br>(818) 547-2010</p><a href="/pages/location-glendale-ii-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Bellflower</h3><p>9509 Alondra Blvd<br>(562) 804-4737</p><a href="/pages/location-bellflower-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Costa Mesa</h3><p>2049 Harbor Blvd<br>(949) 802-6419</p><a href="/pages/location-costa-mesa-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Cathedral City</h3><p>68406 E Palm Canyon Dr<br>(760) 469-9510</p><a href="/pages/location-cathedral-city-ca">Store details →</a></article></div></div></section>
<section class="os"><div class="ow center"><div class="oe">More services</div><h2 class="ot">Related auto services</h2><div class="g3 rel" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="op"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-65.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Brake service"><div class="body"><h3>Brake service</h3><p>Keep braking performance ready for the road.</p><a href="/pages/service-brake-service">Learn more →</a></div></article><article class="op"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-64.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Wheel alignment"><div class="body"><h3>Wheel alignment</h3><p>Support even tire wear and stable steering.</p><a href="/pages/service-wheel-alignment">Learn more →</a></div></article><article class="op"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-66.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Tire installation"><div class="body"><h3>Tire installation</h3><p>Professional installation for tires that fit your vehicle.</p><a href="/pages/service-tire-installation">Learn more →</a></div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="os oa"><div class="ow center"><div class="oe">Good to know</div><h2 class="ot">Oil change FAQ</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>How often should I get an oil change?</summary><p>Most vehicles need service every 5,000 to 7,500 miles, or according to the owner’s manual. Vehicles using full synthetic oil can often go longer.</p></details><details><summary>How long does an oil change take?</summary><p>A standard oil change often takes about 30 to 45 minutes, though timing depends on your vehicle and service needs.</p></details><details><summary>What type of oil do you use?</summary><p>We use the conventional, synthetic-blend, or full-synthetic oil appropriate for your vehicle and manufacturer requirements.</p></details><details><summary>Do you replace the filter?</summary><p>Yes. A new oil filter is included with oil change service.</p></details><details><summary>Is an appointment required?</summary><p>An appointment is recommended so the store can reserve time and confirm availability.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section class="final"><div class="ow"><div class="oe">Engine care starts here</div><h2 class="ot">Ready for an oil change?</h2><p class="ocp">Request an appointment at your nearest American Tire Stores location today.</p><a class="ob" href="#oil-book">Request an appointment →</a></div></section>
</main>
